  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vasudha Foundation Consultation on Energy Transition in South Asia in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heinrich Boell Foundation New Delhi, India along with Vasudha Foundation India partnered with Practical Action Consulting Nepal to host Energy Transition Platform South Asia meeting, where delegates from Afghanistan, Bangladesh, Bhutan, India, Maldives, Pakistan, Sri Lanka and Nepal explored pathways for transitioning to a fossil fuel-free South Asia by 2050. ETP network members will work towards developing strategy to promote ETP and energy transition in South Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
